cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper below."
title: "Multi-sensor traffic reconstruction: regional agent-based traffic simulation from heterogeneous mobility sources"
abstract: >-
  Regional traffic simulation for Emilia-Romagna (Italy) from mobile-phone
  origin-destination demand, an agent-based simulator on an OpenStreetMap-derived
  road graph, inductive loop detectors and GPS probes, with the analysis pipeline,
  HPC workflow and web platform used in the accompanying paper.
